{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB宣布將開拓劇集新賽道，引入現時在內地極之流行的紅果平台「豎屏短劇」模式，而打頭陣的頭炮作品，竟然是200 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB宣布將開拓劇集新賽道，引入現時在內地極之流行的紅果平台「豎屏短劇」模式，而打頭陣的頭炮作品，竟然是2003年經典宮鬥神劇《金枝慾孽》的番外篇《金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳》！消息一出即時震撼全城，官方更率先公開六大主角造型，勢必引爆全網追劇熱潮！\n</p>\n<h2>TVB開拓劇集新賽道 引入內地爆紅豎屏短劇</h2>\n<p>面對觀眾追劇習慣的改變，TVB在2027年將有新搞作，宣佈與內地大型短劇平台「紅果短劇」達成合作，正式開啟劇集新賽道，開拍節奏明快、適合手機觀看的豎屏短劇。這種劇集模式在內地已發展得相當成熟，深受年輕觀眾歡迎，TVB此舉被視為力求革新，緊貼市場潮流的重要一步。而選擇20023年以經典IP《金枝慾孽》打頭陣，足見對此新模式的重視。</p>\n<h2>「番外篇」6大主角曝光 龔嘉欣陳自瑤列陣</h2>\n<p>為隆重其事，TVB在巡禮預告片中，率先公開了番外篇《金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳》的六大主角陣容及造型。名單星光熠熠，包括視帝陳豪，夥拍龔嘉欣、陳自瑤、倪嘉雯、阮浩棕及陳楨怡，造型尚未曝光還有鄭子誠飾演的「皇帝」一角！\n</p>\n<h2>陳豪重演2003年侍衞孔武</h2>\n<p>陳豪飾演的孔武是宮中待衛，在第一集《金枝慾孽》第30集與爾淳成功逃離紫禁城，之後在續集《金枝慾孽貳》飾演「高老闆」高流斐，今之短劇版本他重拾23年前的角色，以黑衣神秘造型再度演出帶刀待衛。</p>\n<h2>陳自瑤倪嘉雯首次同劇演出</h2>\n<p>今次選角入面，經常被指撞樣的陳自瑤與倪嘉雯首次在同劇演出，從曝光的造型照可見，各人服飾華麗，角色性格鮮明，當中陳豪、龔嘉欣與陳自瑤的宮鬥組合，已令不少劇迷引頸以待。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586568017218_426766517_12451559036b012c60b5bf5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1063\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586568017218_426766517_12451559036b012c60b5bf5.jpg\" width=\"812\"/></a><figcaption>倪嘉雯飾演宮女。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586492525819_426766517_13552820556b012c61e867e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1047\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586492525819_426766517_13552820556b012c61e867e.jpg\" width=\"808\"/></a><figcaption>陳自瑤飾演皇后！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179523474757946255_1493959756b011bbc5dc8c-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179523474757946255_1493959756b011bbc5dc8c-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_1631243846b011b0d5ec2e-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_1631243846b011b0d5ec2e-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/42_12710056526b011b12c0422-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/42_12710056526b011b12c0422-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_9880963116b011b16b73fb-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_9880963116b011b16b73fb-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_7619146896b011b1ad70c0-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_7619146896b011b1ad70c0-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_18801961996b011b1fcbcb0-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_18801961996b011b1fcbcb0-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_3610864016b011b25bd086-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_3610864016b011b25bd086-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%87%91%e6%9e%9d%e6%85%be%e5%ad%bd%e4%b9%8b%e5%ae%ae%e7%89%86%e6%8a%98%e6%9f%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%b1%aa/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳豪</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%be%94%e5%98%89%e6%ac%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龔嘉欣</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3547360\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 21 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:03:58.306550+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1145,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T06:45:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:29.665767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:28.864049+00:00","content_hash":"b7588c645aab26397201d387d25ba52df6ae60826cbbfd9bf04bb42c36ed5de1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}